        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S.P. Venkatesh\n- Songs: Chikku Bukku Rayile, Style\n- Films: Gentleman, Punjabi House\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer, score composer\n\nFacts:\n- In 1993, the Tamil song \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" was featured in the film \"Gentleman\".\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer.\n- Suresh Peters's notable songs include \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" from \"Gentleman\" and \"Style\".\n- In \"Punjabi House,\" Suresh Peters composed the songs and made his debut as a film composer.\n- In \"Punjabi House,\" S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.",
